  <h2>BBC Video: Day 6</h2>
  <p>The sixth episode, deep in Mount Song, deepens Holding in Front. New warm-up "Turning Body and Separating Hands" and new cool-down "Guiding Downward Press." Philosophy theme: the power of trees.</p>
  <VideoEmbed videoId="B2LPoUZ_zEo" title="Stand Still Be Fit - Day 6" />

